{"4258570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wall Of Insanity 2", "steam_appid": 4258570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/84fb132ca761c3808188e82899bdf5e7.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/84fb132ca761c3808188e82899bdf5e7.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/84fb132ca761c3808188e82899bdf5e7.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission was supposed to be routine — a police raid on the lair of a dangerous cult. Instead, it unraveled into something far more sinister. <br><br>The squad walked into a <strong>ritual gone wrong — or perhaps exactly as intended</strong>. Those who resisted were found unconscious and severely wounded. The rest vanished without a trace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">REVEAL THE UNSPEAKABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/b3c2c9488f136c180f4b5984413794e1.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/b3c2c9488f136c180f4b5984413794e1.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/b3c2c9488f136c180f4b5984413794e1.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now <strong>you are alone</strong> in a place where reality erodes and memories no longer hold, trapped in a world that feels less like a destination… and more like something that was waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CHALLENGE THE BOUNDARIES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/f1846870ec9c569106c1dd7d35eb564d.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/f1846870ec9c569106c1dd7d35eb564d.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/f1846870ec9c569106c1dd7d35eb564d.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the lone survivor of a compromised unit, you must piece together what happened and uncover the truth behind the cult’s dark power. Trapped within a distorted realm shaped by ancient suffering, you’ll navigate a surreal landscape of bio-organic nightmares, manage dwindling resources, and carve a path through the madness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE THE WORLD<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/5acca09a2b7c4065fa0bd78fb014879f.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/5acca09a2b7c4065fa0bd78fb014879f.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/5acca09a2b7c4065fa0bd78fb014879f.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall of Insanity 2 delivers a decaying and reactive world, high-intensity tactical combat,  and a haunting narrative mystery, blending survival horror with cinematic storytelling in a reality where the laws of physics no longer apply.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/84fb132ca761c3808188e82899bdf5e7.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/84fb132ca761c3808188e82899bdf5e7.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/84fb132ca761c3808188e82899bdf5e7.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission was supposed to be routine — a police raid on the lair of a dangerous cult. Instead, it unraveled into something far more sinister. <br><br>The squad walked into a <strong>ritual gone wrong — or perhaps exactly as intended</strong>. Those who resisted were found unconscious and severely wounded. The rest vanished without a trace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">REVEAL THE UNSPEAKABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/b3c2c9488f136c180f4b5984413794e1.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/b3c2c9488f136c180f4b5984413794e1.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/b3c2c9488f136c180f4b5984413794e1.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now <strong>you are alone</strong> in a place where reality erodes and memories no longer hold, trapped in a world that feels less like a destination… and more like something that was waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">CHALLENGE THE BOUNDARIES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/f1846870ec9c569106c1dd7d35eb564d.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/f1846870ec9c569106c1dd7d35eb564d.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/f1846870ec9c569106c1dd7d35eb564d.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the lone survivor of a compromised unit, you must piece together what happened and uncover the truth behind the cult’s dark power. Trapped within a distorted realm shaped by ancient suffering, you’ll navigate a surreal landscape of bio-organic nightmares, manage dwindling resources, and carve a path through the madness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EXPLORE THE WORLD<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/5acca09a2b7c4065fa0bd78fb014879f.poster.avif?t=1784834434\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/5acca09a2b7c4065fa0bd78fb014879f.webm?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/extras/5acca09a2b7c4065fa0bd78fb014879f.mp4?t=1784834434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall of Insanity 2 delivers a decaying and reactive world, high-intensity tactical combat,  and a haunting narrative mystery, blending survival horror with cinematic storytelling in a reality where the laws of physics no longer apply.</p>", "short_description": "Survive a relentless descent into a bio-organic nightmare. As a member of specialized tactical unit, navigate a decaying dimension to locate a vanished squad. Engage in high-stakes combat where every shadow hides an unspeakable horror. The veil is thinning - will you make it out?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/1caa9ff4b6ef9494e722ed72f79c17dbdb28de85/header.jpg?t=1784834434", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/839d1ce0525b60a00940673e18bc25d974da2100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784834434", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258570/839d1ce0525b60a00940673e18bc25d974da2100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784834434", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel pentium g4560<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2.4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3 3220<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</s